    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chana masala is chickpeas in a thick, tangy tomato and onion sauce. The tartness comes from "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "amchur powder",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amchur"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (dried mango powder), which gives the sauce a sharpness that cuts through the earthiness of the chickpeas. The whole dish takes 30 minutes from tinned chickpeas. It is one of the most satisfying quick vegetarian curries in the Anglo-Indian repertoire."
          }
        ]
      },
